fix: GTO analysis suggestions showing [object Object]

- Fixed renderGTOAnalysis to properly extract text/phase/priority from suggestion objects
- Added phase badges with different icons based on priority level
- Added .suggestion-phase CSS styles for better visual presentation

fix: NPC hand protection - prevent folding with strong hands

- Add hand protection mechanism in makePostflopDecision
- When handStrength >= 0.45, NPC will not fold
- Strong hands (>=0.7) tend to raise for value
- Medium strength hands (0.45-0.7) will at least call
- Fix the issue of NPC folding too easily

feat: Add server debugging tools for Railway multiplayer issues

- Add SERVER_INSTANCE_ID to detect multiple instance deployment
- Add /api/status endpoint for debugging server state
- Display server ID in connection status for players to verify same instance
- Log room count, connected players, and room list in browser console

This helps diagnose if players are connecting to different server instances.fix: chat message showing undefined sender and [object Object]

- Extract messageText from data object in chatMessage handler
- Add sender field to match frontend expectation
- Support both string and object formats for backward compatibility